cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Project AIMS (AI Against Modern Slavery) — Phase 2"
message: >-
  If you use this repository, its datasets, or its models, please cite the
  relevant paper below. AIMS.au is the preferred citation for the dataset;
  AIMSCheck for the review framework.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Open datasets, models, and frameworks for analysing corporate modern slavery
  statements filed under the Australian, UK, and Canadian Modern Slavery Acts,
  including expert sentence-level annotations aligned to mandatory reporting
  criteria.
